<description>&lt;p&gt;The Rapid Support Forces are being pressed by the US for a humanitarian truce as civilian deaths from drone strikes rise, while the UN has called for an immediate end to those attacks. Climate change and El Niño are worsening the humanitarian situation, with hundreds of children dying in Sudan. A Russian diplomat alleges that weapons supplied by the US to Ukraine have been found in RSF possession, adding a new diplomatic dimension to the conflict. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFA0ZXhKSlNkZzkxQTR5M09ZLVZvOC1vRXE2N21CbHo1SEJQZWp2RHh1QmdwTEJSVGVPTFRBRGRyVnJVaVZkZlJHQTFXSmVLbXB2WW5EaVM5emtJekI1bU5vNHYyQjBLN3V2MlRVb0NOMEhuYklVYV9LUkRZemVLZmM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPUHg1YXp3MVU3ekZHLU5EZXhLQmRydmVibWw3T1pqbkZHVXRLNHVxeWljR3llTDFLZnpRVmN2TDFzaEI2MHd0TWtpcGt6c0dUSm14QmQ1amFTMGFLc1RHMkxHeXR6UkcxQU1qejNZeTdLYXBGWVFWdzJUelN0OUtHcXlWeDZLRTRvY0NFRDBBY1NyU3JzX2FOVjZMU05Td1M1bEw2UDQweTFoY05lWlBzcVcwUXVTang0cENiX3pIbE55Z1VZdHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQUHZzVjVQN3ZtdHc2YzVLSU5iXzhZb000REFvQ0ptQW00NmhDZVBpbFZrLUItMVp1U054TzN6MjBITmtWaWhUSVRNbU9vMWRhd1VuNkEzckZFdENrUFFfRDMwU0ZpV1E0U3BIM0xmZnpCTTZOemVCeFlneW01LWdJY3kzNGJ4Zjh3Q1RLLQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Tamazuj&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPcnZ6NWR5NkJuVFpHUmkycFhCVHNSclY1S2h4bnNFdHlRYnVYdmh6OEJrLVdRQjVPVFhCcWw0LTduYU5VZFZWWmh1cE5ScGhrLTFjYVUycjRqcWNqckZCTFRJUTd5c01vVlRrNDZ1dTdHV01TZkdDNEI0Yn